{"slug": "slack", "name": "Slack", "category": "Uncategorized", "summary": "An inspired interpretation of Slacc's design language — a workplace messaging brand built on a deep aubergine primary, with cream-lavender hero gradients, blue inline links, and pill CTAs.", "description": "An inspired interpretation of Slacc's design language — a workplace messaging brand built on a deep aubergine primary, with cream-lavender hero gradients, blue inline links, and pill CTAs. The system pairs a proprietary humanist sans for display with a separate utility sans for body, and stages product UI mockups inside soft pastel-mesh hero composites that act as both decoration and feature explanation.", "colors": [{"name": "Aubergine", "hex": "#4a154b", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary", "role": "The brand's primary surface and CTA color. Deep, warm purple with a hint of ruby — used on filled buttons, the featured pricing tier, the footer band, and the brand wordmark."}, {"name": "Aubergine Deep", "hex": "#481a54", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-deep", "role": "A near-identical sibling of `{colors.primary}` extracted from a different surface; treat as functionally equivalent."}, {"name": "Aubergine Press", "hex": "#611f69", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-press", "role": "Pressed-state lift of the primary, slightly lighter and warmer."}, {"name": "Aubergine Tint", "hex": "#592466", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-tint", "role": "Border accent on aubergine-on-aubergine surfaces."}, {"name": "Link Blue", "hex": "#1264a3", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "link-blue", "role": "Inline link color — saturated, slightly warm blue. The only chromatic alternative to aubergine in body type."}, {"name": "Link Hover", "hex": "#3860be", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "link-hover", "role": "A more saturated blue used on link hover state."}, {"name": "Canvas White", "hex": "#ffffff", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas", "role": "Default co